Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.73,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Itadori. I'm going with paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:52.45,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Rock-paper-scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.72,0:22:54.08,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:56.66,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Sushi, huh? Guess we can go \Nto the usual place in Ginza.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.66,0:22:58.86,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Ginza, yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.03,0:23:00.36,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I want revolving sushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.36,0:23:03.19,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh! Itadori, you're such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.19,0:23:05.14,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh! Fushiguro, say something to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.14,0:23:07.15,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather get something \Nthat tastes good if we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:08.38,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Gojou-sensei's paying, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:09.89,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,Revolving sushi is its own thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.89,0:23:12.70,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,just like how yakisoba and instant\Nyakisoba are different things!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.51,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,And I want to eat sushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.51,0:23:17.44,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,Sushi's just a meal, but \Nrevolving sushi's a leisure activity!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.44,0:23:19.37,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,Like a theme park! Or TDL!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.37,0:23:21.68,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,Also, Kugisaki, you said you \Nwere from the country too,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.68,0:23:23.52,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,so have you ever been to \Na revolving sushi place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.90,0:23:25.63,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,My favorite is Sushi Go,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:27.76,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,but I'd go with Splendid Sushi \Nfor someone's first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.76,0:23:29.17,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,You get it, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.17,0:23:30.51,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, no one's said we're going yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:32.42,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,Kugisaki, listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:34.01,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,At Splendid Sushi...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.38,0:23:36.78,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,the sushi comes to you on a bullet train.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:38.26,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.54,0:23:41.47,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Driver, this girl's never \Nhad revolving sushi before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.21,0:23:44.94,sign_34075_386__Please_ride_in_,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(458,1)}*Please ride in cars properly and safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.47,0:23:44.48,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Take us to the Splendid Sushi with the \Nhuge-ass parking lot along the interstate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.49,0:23:54.95,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1066,1)}Episode 4:\NCurse Womb Must Die